{"title":"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Six different digits from the set\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/6/4565e9ab182fabdfa76eaec506300115b3de96bf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\{ 1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9\\}\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" />\nare placed in the squares in the figure shown so that the sum of the entries in the vertical column is 23 and the sum of the entries in the horizontal row is 12.\nThe sum of the six digits used is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/5/df58d3f5c6f96c4c683cc96e62e3ea5bceab26ed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); draw((0,0)--(1,0)--(1,1)--(4,1)--(4,2)--(1,2)--(1,3)--(0,3)--cycle); draw((0,1)--(1,1)--(1,2)--(0,2)); draw((2,1)--(2,2)); draw((3,1)--(3,2)); label(&quot;$23$&quot;,(0.5,0),S); label(&quot;$12$&quot;,(4,1.5),E); [/asy]\" width=\"152\" height=\"115\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/9/869c8489a017685ad6564776395cfc9f8abc69b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 27 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 29 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 31 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 33 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Looking at the vertical column, the three numbers sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.  If we make the numbers on either end <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in some order, the middle number will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  This is the minimum for the intersection.\n</p><p>Looking at the horizontal row, the four numbers sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.  If we minimize the three numbers on the right to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e25f7c53c416ec43ea033a38f680639c5bcfe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$123$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, the first number has a maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  This is the maximum for the intersection\n</p><p>Thus, the minimum of the intersection is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the maximum of the intersection is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  This means the intersection must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the other numbers must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the column, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e25f7c53c416ec43ea033a38f680639c5bcfe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$123$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> in the row.  The sum of all the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/2/682359666313dee3fb09b2d2cd8ca01efbfeff70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 + 23 - 6 = \\boxed{\\text{(B)}\\ 29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"176\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME\" title=\"1996 AJHSME\">1996 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1996\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AJHSME\" class=\"mw-redir